{
  "id": "b2-e42-children-and-screens",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Children and screens",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, did you have a computer or tablet when you were a child?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what did you do after school as a child?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think children today have different childhoods?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how much time do children in your family spend on screens?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e42-a1",
            "b2-e42-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show children spending their free time. Compare the photographs, and say what the advantages and disadvantages of these activities might be.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, how did you spend your free time as a child?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e42-b1",
            "b2-e42-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people in different age groups. Compare the photographs, and say how the people might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think families should have time without screens?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways to help children use screens more sensibly, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e42-children-and-screens",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these ideas help children use screens more sensibly?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e42-children-and-screens",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about children and screen time.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that screens harm children's development. What is your opinion?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, at what age do you think a child should get a phone?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think schools should ban phones?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it parents' or teachers' responsibility to teach children about the internet?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, what activities do you think are better for children than screens?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e42-children-and-screens/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
